:::style
.layout-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 18pt; margin: 18pt 0; }
.layout-card { padding: 14pt; border: 0.5pt solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 6pt; background-color: #f8fafc; }
.layout-row { display: flex; gap: 12pt; margin: 12pt 0; }
.layout-row .layout-card { flex: 1; }
.font-system { font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; }
.font-serif { font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif; }
.font-mono { font-family: ui-monospace, "SFMono-Regular", Menlo, monospace; }
.font-humanist { font-family: "Gill Sans", "Trebuchet MS", sans-serif; }
.margin-demo { margin: 20pt 8pt 12pt 28pt; padding: 10pt 14pt; border-inline-start: 4pt solid #0f766e; background-color: #ecfdf5; }
::: style

:::toc {#contents role="primary" depth="2" title="Contents"}
:::

# Layout And Font Showcase {#title}

This document exists to make renderer behavior visible: horizontal layout,
grid layout, margins, padding, and font-family selection.

::::section {#font-rows}
## Font Rows {#font-rows-heading}

:::note {.font-system type="info"}
System UI font row: the quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog. 0123456789.
::: note

:::note {.font-serif type="info"}
Serif font row: the quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog. 0123456789.
::: note

:::note {.font-mono type="info"}
Monospace font row: the quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog. 0123456789.
::: note

:::note {.font-humanist type="info"}
Humanist sans row: the quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog. 0123456789.
::: note
:::: section

